{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-10-22T03:10:56.338Z","tool_name":"update_topic","tool_id":"update_topic__call_242545","parameters":{"summary":"By comparing our Iteration 6 model against the consistent miners in the field and decomposing CRPS across scoring intervals and volatility regimes on pre-validation RealizedPathStore data, I discovered two key phenomena: (1) in 24h competitions, predicted volatility is over-compressed toward the mean (too wide in low-volatility regimes and too narrow in high-volatility breakouts), and (2) in CRYPTO_1H, multi-step cumulative intervals (15m, 30m, 60m, Gaps) have a lower CRPS-optimal scale than 1m/5m steps and volatility blocks. I will now run a pre-validation residual analysis of the exact per-prompt CRPS-optimal log-scale ln(s*_i) against context features and horizon intervals.","strategic_intent":"Measure exact per-prompt CRPS-optimal log-scale residuals on pre-validation data (2026-06-25 to 2026-09-13) against context features and scoring intervals.","title":"Pre-Validation CRPS Log-Scale Residual Analysis"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-10-22T03:11:16.622Z","tool_name":"run_shell_command","tool_id":"run_shell_command__call_242607","parameters":{"command":"uv run python -c \"\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom concurrent.futures import ProcessPoolExecutor\nfrom scipy.optimize import minimize_scalar\nfrom synth.validator.competition_config import CRYPTO_1H, CRYPTO_24H, COM_EQU_24H\nfrom synth.validator.crps_calculation import calculate_total_score_for_miner\nfrom synth_lib.benchmark.generate_predictions import load_minute_prices, context_end\nfrom synth_lib.preparation.realized_path_store import RealizedPathStore\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, 'agent')\nfrom modeling import (\n    simulate, _S2_BACK_336, _index_to_utc_us, _slots_from_utc_us, _subslot_modulation,\n    _event_variance_multiplier, EWMA_LAMBDAS_6, _compute_5m_mad_ewma, _compute_ohlc_log_ewma,\n    LONG_TERM_SIGMA_1M\n)\n\ndef _analyze_prompt(args):\n    asset, t0_iso, ti, tl, intervals, vol_blocks, real, ctx = args\n    out = simulate(asset, t0_iso, ti, tl, 200, ctx)\n    paths = np.asarray(out[2:], dtype=np.float64)\n    p0 = paths[:, :1]\n    log_p = np.log(paths / p0)\n    \n    # Find optimal scale multiplier s* for this prompt\n    def obj(log_s):\n        s = np.exp(log_s)\n        spaths = p0 * np.exp(s * log_p)\n        sc, _ = calculate_total_score_for_miner(spaths, real, ti, intervals, vol_blocks)\n        return sc\n    \n    c0 = obj(0.0)\n    if c0 < 0:\n        return None\n    res = minimize_scalar(obj, bounds=(-0.8, 0.8), method='bounded', options={'xatol': 0.01})\n    log_s_opt = float(res.x)\n    c_opt = float(res.fun)\n    weight = max(c0, 1.0)\n    \n    # Extract context features\n    vals = ctx['close'].to_numpy(dtype=np.float64)\n    valid_pos = np.flatnonzero(np.isfinite(vals))\n    grid_us = _index_to_utc_us(ctx.index)\n    is_1h = tl <= 3600\n    s2_back = _S2_BACK_336[asset]\n    grid_s2 = s2_back[_slots_from_utc_us(grid_us)] * _subslot_modulation(grid_us, asset, is_1h) * _event_variance_multiplier(grid_us, asset)\n    grid_s2_cumsum = np.concatenate(([0.0], np.cumsum(grid_s2)))\n    rets = np.diff(np.log(vals[valid_pos]))\n    ds2 = np.maximum(grid_s2_cumsum[valid_pos[1:] + 1] - grid_s2_cumsum[valid_pos[:-1] + 1], 1e-4)\n    rate_ds = (rets ** 2) / ds2\n    pos_rates = rate_ds[rate_ds > 0]\n    cap_ds = float(np.percentile(pos_rates, 98.5)) if pos_rates.size > 10 else 1.0\n    r2_win = np.minimum(rate_ds, cap_ds) * ds2\n    r1_scaled = 1.2533141373155001 * np.abs(rets) * np.sqrt(ds2)\n    t_end_us = int(grid_us[-1])\n    valid_us = grid_us[valid_pos]\n    age_bar_min = np.maximum((t_end_us - 0.5 * (valid_us[1:] + valid_us[:-1])) / 60_000_000.0, 0.0)\n    g_slice = slice(int(valid_pos[0]), len(grid_us))\n    age_grid_min = np.maximum((t_end_us - grid_us[g_slice]) / 60_000_000.0, 0.0)\n    s2_grid_active = grid_s2[g_slice]\n    ewma_l2 = np.empty(6)\n    ewma_l1 = np.empty(6)\n    ewma_raw_l2 = np.empty(6)\n    for i, lam in enumerate(EWMA_LAMBDAS_6):\n        w_bar = np.exp(-lam * age_bar_min)\n        w_grid = np.exp(-lam * age_grid_min)\n        den = max(float(np.dot(w_grid, s2_grid_active)), 1e-6)\n        ewma_l2[i] = np.sqrt(max(float(np.dot(w_bar, r2_win)) / den, 1e-12))\n        ewma_raw_l2[i] = np.sqrt(max(float(np.dot(w_bar, rets**2)) / den, 1e-12))\n        ewma_l1[i] = max(float(np.dot(w_bar, r1_scaled)) / den, 1e-6)\n    log_l2 = np.log(ewma_l2)\n    log_raw_l2 = np.log(ewma_raw_l2)\n    log_l1 = np.log(ewma_l1)\n    log_mad5 = _compute_5m_mad_ewma(valid_pos, rets, grid_us, grid_s2)\n    log_hl = _compute_ohlc_log_ewma(ctx, g_slice, age_grid_min, s2_grid_active, float(log_l2[5]))\n    \n    # Recent NaN fraction (last 24h vs 7d)\n    nan_24h = float(np.mean(~np.isfinite(vals[-1440:])))\n    nan_7d = float(np.mean(~np.isfinite(vals)))\n    # Signed 24h deseasonalized return\n    idx_24h = np.searchsorted(valid_pos, max(0, len(vals) - 1440))\n    ret_24h = float(np.log(vals[valid_pos[-1]] / vals[valid_pos[idx_24h]])) / max(np.sqrt(np.sum(grid_s2[-1440:])) * ewma_l2[5], 1e-6)\n    \n    return {\n        't0': t0_iso, 'c0': c0, 'c_opt': c_opt, 'log_s_opt': log_s_opt, 'weight': weight,\n        'log_l2': log_l2, 'log_raw_l2': log_raw_l2, 'log_l1': log_l1, 'log_mad5': log_mad5, 'log_hl': log_hl,\n        'nan_24h': nan_24h, 'nan_7d': nan_7d, 'ret_24h': ret_24h,\n        'pred_log_vol': float(np.log(np.std(log_p[:, -1]))),\n    }\n\nwith ProcessPoolExecutor(max_workers=12) as ex:\n    for comp in [CRYPTO_24H, COM_EQU_24H, CRYPTO_1H]:\n        for asset in comp.asset_list:\n            store = RealizedPathStore(asset, comp.time_length, comp.time_increment)\n            days = pd.date_range('2026-07-24', '2026-09-12', freq='2D')\n            all_p = []\n            p_stride = 24 if comp.time_length <= 3600 else 4\n            for d in days:\n                entries = store._load_day(d.date())\n                for t0 in sorted(entries)[::p_stride]:\n                    rp = np.asarray(entries[t0], dtype=np.float64)\n                    if not np.all(np.isnan(rp)):\n                        all_p.append((t0, rp))\n            prices = load_minute_prices(Path('market_data'), asset, all_p[0][0] - pd.Timedelta(days=8), all_p[-1][0] + pd.Timedelta(days=1))\n            tasks = [\n                (asset, t0.isoformat(), comp.time_increment, comp.time_length, comp.scoring_intervals, comp.vol_scoring_blocks, rp,\n                 prices.loc[t0 - pd.Timedelta(days=7) : context_end(t0, comp.time_length)])\n                for t0, rp in all_p\n            ]\n            rows = [r for r in ex.map(_analyze_prompt, tasks) if r is not None]\n            ls = np.array([r['log_s_opt'] for r in rows])\n            w = np.array([r['weight'] for r in rows])\n            pv = np.array([r['pred_log_vol'] for r in rows])\n            l2_5 = np.array([r['log_l2'][5] for r in rows]) - np.log(LONG_TERM_SIGMA_1M[asset])\n            l2_slope = np.array([r['log_l2'][2] - r['log_l2'][5] for r in rows])\n            l1_diff = np.array([r['log_l1'][4] - r['log_l2'][4] for r in rows])\n            mad5_diff = np.array([r['log_mad5'][4] - r['log_l2'][4] for r in rows])\n            ret24 = np.array([r['ret_24h'] for r in rows])\n            w_mean = np.average(ls, weights=w)\n            # weighted correlations with log_s_opt\n            def wcorr(x, y, w):\n                mx = np.average(x, weights=w); my = np.average(y, weights=w)\n                cov = np.average((x - mx)*(y - my), weights=w)\n                return cov / max(np.sqrt(np.average((x-mx)**2, weights=w)*np.average((y-my)**2, weights=w)), 1e-8)\n            print(f'{comp.label[:10]:<10} {asset:<7} (n={len(rows):3d}) | wmean(log_s*)={w_mean:+.3f} | corr(lvl)={wcorr(l2_5, ls, w):+.2f} | corr(1h-7d)={wcorr(l2_slope, ls, w):+.2f} | corr(l1-l2)={wcorr(l1_diff, ls, w):+.2f} | corr(mad5-l2)={wcorr(mad5_diff, ls, w):+.2f} | corr(ret24)={wcorr(ret24, ls, w):+.2f}', flush=True)\n\"","description":"Analyze exact per-prompt CRPS-optimal log-scale residuals against context features across all 18 pairs on pre-validation data"}}
{"type":"tool_result","timestamp":"2026-10-22T03:26:10.626Z","tool_id":"update_topic__call_242545","status":"success","output":"## 📂 Topic: **Pre-Validation CRPS Log-Scale Residual Analysis**\n\n**Summary:**\nBy comparing our Iteration 6 model against the consistent miners in the field and decomposing CRPS across scoring intervals and volatility regimes on pre-validation RealizedPathStore data, I discovered two key phenomena: (1) in 24h competitions, predicted volatility is over-compressed toward the mean (too wide in low-volatility regimes and too narrow in high-volatility breakouts), and (2) in CRYPTO_1H, multi-step cumulative intervals (15m, 30m, 60m, Gaps) have a lower CRPS-optimal scale than 1m/5m steps and volatility blocks. I will now run a pre-validation residual analysis of the exact per-prompt CRPS-optimal log-scale ln(s*_i) against context features and horizon intervals.\n\n> [!STRATEGY]\n> **Intent:** Measure exact per-prompt CRPS-optimal log-scale residuals on pre-validation data (2026-06-25 to 2026-09-13) against context features and scoring intervals."}
