{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-10-22T04:49:27.812Z","tool_name":"update_topic","tool_id":"update_topic__call_246288","parameters":{"summary":"Our pre-validation residual diagnostics revealed that in CRYPTO_1H, our Iteration 6 model already beats the #1 subnet miner on weekdays (-1.2 to -2.9 CRPS) and loses almost exclusively on weekends (+4.1 to +5.4 CRPS) and during the 08-12 UTC / 16-20 UTC diurnal transitions because line 311 bypassed _S2_FWD_336 for 1h prompts and short EWMAs suffer from Jensen/phase lag across the diurnal cycle. I will now test fixing 1h forward seasonality and debiased EWMA weights on the pre-validation splits (Pre-Half 1 and Pre-Half 2).","strategic_intent":"Test and validate CRYPTO_1H improvements (forward weekend/diurnal seasonality calibration and Jensen-debiased EWMA) on pre-validation splits.","title":"Optimizing CRYPTO_1H Calibration on Pre-Validation Data"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-10-22T04:49:40.424Z","tool_name":"run_shell_command","tool_id":"run_shell_command__call_246306","parameters":{"description":"Analyze CRYPTO_1H session residuals across Pre-Half 1 and Pre-Half 2","command":"uv run python -c \"\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom concurrent.futures import ProcessPoolExecutor\nfrom synth.validator.competition_config import CRYPTO_1H\nfrom synth.validator.crps_calculation import calculate_total_score_for_miner\nfrom synth_lib.benchmark.generate_predictions import load_minute_prices, context_end\nfrom synth_lib.preparation.realized_path_store import RealizedPathStore\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, 'agent')\nimport modeling as mod\n\n# Let's measure exact du* by (is_weekend, 4h_block) on Pre-Half 1 (07-16..08-14) and Pre-Half 2 (08-15..09-13) for CRYPTO_1H\ndef _eval_1h_prompt(args):\n    asset, t0_iso, real, ctx = args\n    out = mod.simulate(asset, t0_iso, 60, 3600, 250, ctx)\n    paths = np.asarray(out[2:], dtype=np.float64)\n    p0 = paths[:, :1]; log_p = np.log(paths / p0)\n    du = 0.08\n    c0, _ = calculate_total_score_for_miner(paths, real, 60, CRYPTO_1H.scoring_intervals, CRYPTO_1H.vol_scoring_blocks)\n    if c0 < 0: return None\n    cp, _ = calculate_total_score_for_miner(p0 * np.exp(np.exp(du)*log_p), real, 60, CRYPTO_1H.scoring_intervals, CRYPTO_1H.vol_scoring_blocks)\n    cm, _ = calculate_total_score_for_miner(p0 * np.exp(np.exp(-du)*log_p), real, 60, CRYPTO_1H.scoring_intervals, CRYPTO_1H.vol_scoring_blocks)\n    t0 = pd.Timestamp(t0_iso)\n    return {'t0': t0, 'dow': t0.dayofweek, 'hour': t0.hour, 'c0': c0, 'g': (cp - cm)/(2*du), 'h': max((cp - 2*c0 + cm)/(du*du), 1.0)}\n\nwith ProcessPoolExecutor(max_workers=12) as ex:\n    all_dfs = {}\n    for asset in CRYPTO_1H.asset_list:\n        store = RealizedPathStore(asset, 3600, 60)\n        days = pd.date_range('2026-07-16', '2026-09-13', freq='1D')\n        all_p = []\n        for d in days:\n            entries = store._load_day(d.date())\n            for t0 in sorted(entries)[::12]:\n                rp = np.asarray(entries[t0], dtype=np.float64)\n                if not np.all(np.isnan(rp)):\n                    all_p.append((t0, rp))\n        prices = load_minute_prices(Path('market_data'), asset, all_p[0][0] - pd.Timedelta(days=8), all_p[-1][0] + pd.Timedelta(days=1))\n        tasks = [\n            (asset, t0.isoformat(), rp, prices.loc[t0 - pd.Timedelta(days=7) : context_end(t0, 3600)])\n            for t0, rp in all_p\n        ]\n        df = pd.DataFrame([r for r in ex.map(_eval_1h_prompt, tasks) if r is not None])\n        all_dfs[asset] = df\n        h1 = df[df['t0'] < '2026-08-15']\n        h2 = df[df['t0'] >= '2026-08-15']\n        print(f'=== {asset} (n={len(df)}) ===', flush=True)\n        for name, cond in [\n            ('Wk_00_08', (df['dow']<5) & (df['hour']<8)),\n            ('Wk_08_13', (df['dow']<5) & (df['hour']>=8) & (df['hour']<13)),\n            ('Wk_13_16', (df['dow']<5) & (df['hour']>=13) & (df['hour']<16)),\n            ('Wk_16_20', (df['dow']<5) & (df['hour']>=16) & (df['hour']<20)),\n            ('Wk_20_24', (df['dow']<5) & (df['hour']>=20)),\n            ('Sat', df['dow']==5),\n            ('Sun', df['dow']==6),\n        ]:\n            s1 = df[cond & (df['t0'] < '2026-08-15')]\n            s2 = df[cond & (df['t0'] >= '2026-08-15')]\n            s_all = df[cond]\n            u1 = -s1['g'].sum()/s1['h'].sum() if len(s1) else 0\n            u2 = -s2['g'].sum()/s2['h'].sum() if len(s2) else 0\n            ua = -s_all['g'].sum()/s_all['h'].sum() if len(s_all) else 0\n            gain = 0.5 * (s_all['g'].sum()**2) / s_all['h'].sum() / len(df)\n            print(f'  {name:<10}: du*={ua:+.3f} (H1:{u1:+.3f}, H2:{u2:+.3f}) | avg_CRPS_gain={-gain:+.3f}', flush=True)\n\""}}
{"type":"tool_result","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:00:24.629Z","tool_id":"update_topic__call_246288","status":"success","output":"## 📂 Topic: **Optimizing CRYPTO_1H Calibration on Pre-Validation Data**\n\n**Summary:**\nOur pre-validation residual diagnostics revealed that in CRYPTO_1H, our Iteration 6 model already beats the #1 subnet miner on weekdays (-1.2 to -2.9 CRPS) and loses almost exclusively on weekends (+4.1 to +5.4 CRPS) and during the 08-12 UTC / 16-20 UTC diurnal transitions because line 311 bypassed _S2_FWD_336 for 1h prompts and short EWMAs suffer from Jensen/phase lag across the diurnal cycle. I will now test fixing 1h forward seasonality and debiased EWMA weights on the pre-validation splits (Pre-Half 1 and Pre-Half 2).\n\n> [!STRATEGY]\n> **Intent:** Test and validate CRYPTO_1H improvements (forward weekend/diurnal seasonality calibration and Jensen-debiased EWMA) on pre-validation splits."}
